I just ruined a second great game by blowing up my bag of holding accidentally
with a wand of cancellation.  The first time I meant to #loot a chest, but
I Applied my bag of holding instead, putting the wand in it.  The second
time, I accidentally hit "a" while putting in my tinning kit, so my sack
containing the wand went in.  On this basis, I don't plan to ever carry
wands of cancellation after I get a bag of holding again, since the cost 
of a mistake is so great.  

So, can anyone tell me, what good is a wand of cancellation?  The only use I
can think of is getting rid of a curse in order to take off a cursed item,
but doesn't zapping yourself with a wand of cancellation cancel all of your
intrinsics?  That seems like a high cost to pay, except for for very early
in the game.

B.t.w., in the game I just ruined, I was playing Hildy the Valkyrie, 23rd
level, armor class -26, about level 45 in Gehennom when I blew up my
bag of holding, destroying:

   The Orb of Fate
   The Blessed Platinum Yendorian Express Card
   a wand of wishing(2)
   The Blessed Mjollnir(+6)
   7 candles
   one each of almost all the useful wands in the game
   a ring of levitation
   boots of water walking
   a Magic Marker(65)

I was left with The Blessed Rustproof Vorpal Blade(+7), boots of speed,
gauntlets of power, shield of reflection, helm of brilliance, cloak of
displacement, a Hawaiian shirt, blue dragon scale mail, and the bell
of opening.  Unfortunately, I no longer had magic resistance, since I
was counting on the Platinum Yendorian Express Card for that.  Fortunately,
I had already genocided "L" and "V". 

Vlads tower was no trouble, but I couldn't find any means of crossing water
(boots or ring of levitation, boots of water walking, amulet of magical 
breathing, wand of cold; any others?) or any way to level teleport, so I 
couldn't get to the wizard, and I couldn't get back up to get to the Gnomish 
mines and see if there were seven candles left.  Other things I couldn't get 
to that I had stashed in chests above the Medusa level that would have been 
useful were a bag of holding and a couple of wands of polymorph.  Sigh...
